The Mist is the fourth zone in the [[Fight|Fight Screen]], featuring 21 unique enemies. Defeating Keymaster Z at the end of the zone unlocks access to the next zone, [[Dungeon]]. Clearing The Mist also unlocks the fourth row of [[Ascension]] perks and unlocks [[Rebirth|Rebirth]], a second way to Ascend.

Every monster in the The Mist has a 1/420 chance to drop a unique [[Cards|Card]], and have +60% chance afterwards to drop higher quality star cards.

